        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFT0oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc4cQADnJdWR6lbmf4BfkLvo09R3b\ndu+RUVPiCpZT+MoBrm+dhWPQabMxkwpSALDw2p3b9SGto/nkBKz4mz4ZvcFY+Rfi\nMBW6pFDcG3Sy+CyUEN/rH62uW0rwz6KW82bUZ355i/qPo/eFbo7QtcTotkHSx4gQ\ngqRvMRmXvN4jQUQ5nlu8QhOwNnTEuJYZLBl6jppH8a4v1l0dyz4z8FFMkx9J8DKv\nGRZVyKbMp7A9yIAD+5CLJDvZebaXx4O4XhFY6zGCSTUEjHFjwWkNLHewa7t861iM\nQpsirLE50MT9H1BYDP6+yINXOk8RvTL/XuC+CWTDt8boJTjJJc233pF4P0iWQ4g2\nY++ThyR/ow5oPS//vPMMXGEQBEe/KsakNnHMnm4kl2I3pTtAd06MupAeoJTV/3Pm\nXnBZJiUIOhKwQuzEyT9elkLv9ts7lwIp3OKOxFp5cKCHHjdzOh93A1nfhO6bA0b+\nkhlINjVvUsCYdwFtgDtsF073iRTm3joUv35lGpPBLx5kKRh9dgkkRua7dGxxfIZZ\nVOfXpio0cFZ+EZxDLBNZm54t/8jKs30O2EG4D2Of/6Y6oZr4GmR9ppkXPIJeIpBk\nEkLobvB2NbzDD4vVYt/C/suAj56p7qZ3/iLMVxo3VsfiXB9Ci8gF7hiEkLvkgtmW\niQdlWid5ORjHty9oKmt8\n=m/XJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 3a8cf8516602658335bf8528f630cc158419bdd2\nparent 0d0c40a31bde8da7a887de8f1979dd89433381e0\nauthor Meylis <meylis@divine.video> 1779776808 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779776808 +0500\n\ntest(notifications): stabilize flaky large-text overflow tests on CI (#4719) (#4721)\n\n* test(notifications): pin surface size for video row large-text test (#4719)\n\nThe 2x \"does not overflow at large text sizes\" test never pinned a surface,\nso its layout height was the ambient (or cross-file-leaked) surface under\nCI's shared-isolate randomized run (very_good test --optimization\n--test-randomize-ordering-seed random). The 2x stacked content (~672px)\ncleared the default usable height by only a few pixels, so Linux font drift\ntipped it into a vertical RenderFlex overflow ~50-60% of runs while macOS in\nisolation always cleared it. Pin a tall 420x1200 surface (matching the stable\nnotification_rows golden) and reset it via addTearDown; width stays 320 so the\nreal horizontal-fit guard is intact. Switch pump() to pumpAndSettle().\n\n* test(notifications): pin surface size for actor row large-text test (#4719)\n\nactor_notification_row_test shares the identical unpinned _pump pattern and\nits own 2x \"does not overflow\" test, so it carries the same latent CI flake\n(vertical RenderFlex overflow when a short surface is inherited under the\nshared-isolate randomized run). Apply the same tall-surface pin + reset +\npumpAndSettle preemptively so it can't become the next #4719.",
